    "text": "Ammonium carbonate dissociates as<br />\r<math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>NH</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>COONH</mtext></mrow> <mtext>4</mtext> </msub> <mtext>(s)</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇌</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mrow> <mtext>2NH</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> <mtext>(g)</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mrow> <mtext>CO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mtext>(g)</mtext></mrow> </math><br />\rIn a closed vessel having ammonium carbonate in equilibrium <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> is added such that partial pressure of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> now to equals to the original total pressure. The ratio of total pressure now the original pressure is?"
