  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>NH</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>COONH</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>4</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>(s)</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mo>&#x21CC;</mo><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>2NH</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>3</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>(g)</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>CO</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>(g)</mtext></mrow></math><br />Suppose P is pressure of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> at equilibrium than<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math><br />As <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />On adding <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> at equilibrium<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math><br />So <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math><br />Now total <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math><br />Hence pressure ratio <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
